<p><%= @user.name %> invited you to a dropin!</p>

<% unless @message.empty? %>
    <p>message from <%= @user.name %>:</p>
    <p><%= @message %></p>
<% end %>

<p>
  Do you have an account with the website Dropins?
  If not, you should totally sign up and let <%= @user.name %>
  know whether you are coming to the dropin or not.  Here is
  the <%= link_to 'link to sign up', @signup_url %>
</p>

<p>
  Already have an account?  Here's the <%= link_to 'link to the dropin', @url %>!
</p>